1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,937
A full workflow: implement, test, retry, review, human approval

2
00:00:04,987 --> 00:00:12,637
n starts a new task: describe it in plain words

3
00:00:12,687 --> 00:00:17,937
Choose the workflow: implement-review-demo

4
00:00:17,987 --> 00:00:20,337
ctrl+s queues it, enter follows the run

5
00:00:20,387 --> 00:00:23,337
The agent implements the change in its own worktree

6
00:00:23,387 --> 00:00:26,337
The tests run...

7
00:00:26,387 --> 00:00:29,337
...and fail. The failure log goes back to the same agent,
which keeps its context

8
00:00:29,387 --> 00:00:32,337
Second attempt: the tests run again

9
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:35,437
Tests pass. A separate reviewer agent checks the diff

10
00:00:35,487 --> 00:00:40,737
Review approved. Nothing ships without you:
the run waits for your approval

11
00:00:40,787 --> 00:00:42,337
a shows what is waiting for you

12
00:00:42,387 --> 00:00:46,737
Tests pass, the review approved. Ship it?

13
00:00:46,787 --> 00:00:49,337
y approves

14
00:00:49,387 --> 00:00:57,830
Done. Nothing is merged or deployed automatically.

